---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Otter Homecare — Compassionate home care in Wiltshire & Somerset"
  description="Warm, flexible home care from a small, local team across Trowbridge, Bradford-on-Avon, Melksham, Westbury and Frome. CQC regulated. Book a free assessment."
>
<header class="hero" id="top"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="hero-copy"> <span class="eyebrow">Local home care in Wiltshire &amp; Somerset</span> <h1 style="margin-top:18px">We look after your loved ones</h1> <span class="hero-like">… <span class="hl-hand">like family</span></span> <p class="sub">Warm, flexible home care from a small, local team — from live-in support to a friendly visit and a cup of tea.</p> </div> <div class="hero-media arch"> <div class="main"><img src="/img/ff72ba_82b85220c73d4bf3b00cc07f8605e8f0~mv2.jpg" alt="An Otter carer sharing a warm moment with a client in the garden"></div> <div class="hero-badge"><span class="em">9.4</span><div><span class="stars">★★★★★</span><b>Rated by families</b><img class="hc-logo" src="/assets/homecare-logo.png" alt="Reviewed on homecare.co.uk"></div></div> </div> <div class="hero-cta"> <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="#book">Book a free assessment <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a> <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="tel:01225690022"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.36 1.9.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.91.34 1.85.57 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg>Call 01225 690022</a> <div class="hero-trust"> <div class="ht-avatars"><span style="background:#17687D">F</span><span style="background:#D8B65E;color:#3a2a06">H</span><span style="background:#C8643C">E</span><span style="background:#0F4F60">J</span></div> <div class="ht-text"><span class="ht-stars">★★★★★</span><b>Loved by families across Wiltshire &amp; Somerset</b><small>Real reviews on homecare.co.uk</small></div> </div> </div> </div> </header>  <div class="wave wave--to-teal" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 1200 90" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path class="rip-back" d="M0,34 C200,66 420,8 640,34 C860,60 1020,24 1200,42 L1200,90 L0,90 Z"></path><path class="rip-front" d="M0,60 C240,90 470,40 700,60 C940,80 1080,54 1200,66 L1200,90 L0,90 Z"></path></svg></div><section class="proof"><div class="wrap"><span class="proof-eyebrow">Why families choose Otter</span><div class="proof-grid"><div class="pf reveal"><span class="pf-ic"><img src="/assets/icons/home.svg" alt=""></span><b>Free home visit</b><small>A relaxed, no-obligation chat at home</small></div><div class="pf reveal"><span class="pf-ic"><img src="/assets/icons/pound.svg" alt=""></span><b>No call-out fees</b><small>Pay only for the care you use</small></div><div class="pf reveal"><span class="pf-ic"><img src="/assets/icons/team.svg" alt=""></span><b>Directly-employed team</b><small>Our own people, never agency staff</small></div><div class="pf reveal"><span class="pf-ic"><img src="/assets/icons/pin.svg" alt=""></span><b>Local &amp; family-run</b><small>One Wiltshire team — never a national branch</small></div></div></div></section>  <section class="section founder" id="founder"> <div class="wrap"> <h2 class="founder-head reveal">It started with caring for my own father</h2> <div class="video-embed reveal" data-yt="BFJ9QbUBr9I" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Play: Hi, I'm Jamie — why I started Otter"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/BFJ9QbUBr9I/maxresdefault.jpg" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='https://img.youtube.com/vi/BFJ9QbUBr9I/hqdefault.jpg'" alt="Jamie, founder of Otter Homecare, speaking to camera"><span class="playbtn"><span></span></span><span class="vlabel">Watch: Hi, I'm Jamie — why I started Otter</span></div> <div class="reveal founder-text"> <blockquote>"Otter was born after my own father had a stroke and I became his main carer. Combined with twenty years living in Asia — where older generations are deeply respected — it inspired a kinder, more personal kind of care, here in Wiltshire and Somerset."</blockquote> <div class="sig">Jamie Rowland-Jones<span>Founder, Otter Homecare</span></div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="section promise" id="promise"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="head-c reveal"> <h2>Our promise to your family</h2> <p class="lede">Four values guide everyone at Otter. Read the first letter of each below — and you'll see why our otter wears a kilt.</p> </div> <div class="promise-row"> <div class="promise-otter reveal"> <div class="promise-bubble" id="kiltBubble"><span class="kb-in"><span class="kb-label" style="display:none"></span><span class="kb-quote">That's why I wear the kilt!</span></span></div> <img src="/assets/otter-kilt.png" alt="The Otter Homecare mascot wearing a tartan kilt — a nod to our four values: Kindness, Initiative, Learning, Teamwork" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="promise-list reveal"> <div class="pl"><span class="pl-val"><span class="ini">K</span>indness</span><div class="pl-body"><h3>Care that feels like family</h3><p>Carers matched to your loved one for genuine warmth and patience — every single visit.</p></div></div> <div class="pl"><span class="pl-val"><span class="ini">I</span>nitiative</span><div class="pl-body"><h3>Always going the extra mile</h3><p>We take the initiative — spotting what would help and acting on it, from a thoughtful extra touch to smart tools like our Care App.</p></div></div> <div class="pl"><span class="pl-val"><span class="ini">L</span>earning</span><div class="pl-body"><h3>A team that keeps getting better at caring for you</h3><p>Directly employed carers, properly trained and always improving how they support you.</p></div></div> <div class="pl"><span class="pl-val"><span class="ini">T</span>eamwork</span><div class="pl-body"><h3>A reliable team around your loved one</h3><p>A small, familiar group who know your routine — never just one person, never a stranger.</p></div></div> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="section services" id="services"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="head-c reveal"> <span class="dots-motif" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/otter-tt.png" alt=""></span> <h2>Care for the people you love most</h2> <p class="lede">Whether it's for a parent, a partner, or yourself, we'll wrap our care gently around the person — and the life they already love.</p> </div> <div class="svc-grid"> <a class="svc svc-feature reveal" href="/live-in-care"><div class="img"><img src="/img/svc-livein.jpg" alt=""></div><div class="body"><span class="svc-ic"><img src="/assets/icons/home.svg" alt=""></span><h3>Live-in Care</h3><p>Expert round-the-clock care in the comfort of your own home — a warm, one-to-one alternative to a care home.</p><span class="more">Learn more →</span></div></a> <a class="svc reveal" href="/personal-care"><div class="img"><img src="/img/svc-personal.jpg" alt=""></div><div class="body"><span class="svc-ic"><img src="/assets/icons/clock.svg" alt=""></span><h3>Personal Care</h3><p>Everyday help with washing, dressing, medication and meals — flexible visits, as much or as little as you need.</p><span class="more">Learn more →</span></div></a> <a class="svc reveal" href="/conditions"><div class="img"><img src="/img/svc-specialist.jpg" alt=""></div><div class="body"><span class="svc-ic"><img src="/assets/icons/heart.svg" alt=""></span><h3>Conditions We Care For</h3><p>Specialist support for dementia, recovery and a range of conditions.</p><span class="more">Learn more →</span></div></a> <a class="svc svc-wide reveal" href="/companionship"><div class="img"><img src="/img/ff72ba_82b85220c73d4bf3b00cc07f8605e8f0~mv2.jpg" alt=""></div><div class="body"><span class="svc-ic"><img src="/assets/icons/mug.svg" alt=""></span><h3>Companionship</h3><p>A friendly face, shared hobbies and genuine connection, every visit — because good company is care too.</p><span class="more">Learn more →</span></div></a> </div> </div> </section> <div class="wave wave--to-teal" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 1200 90" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path class="rip-back" d="M0,34 C200,66 420,8 640,34 C860,60 1020,24 1200,42 L1200,90 L0,90 Z"></path><path class="rip-front" d="M0,60 C240,90 470,40 700,60 C940,80 1080,54 1200,66 L1200,90 L0,90 Z"></path></svg></div>  <section class="section diff" id="diff"> <div class="wrap diff-wrap"> <div class="diff-intro reveal"> <h2>What makes us different</h2> <p>We're one local team who answer the phone ourselves — not a branch of a national chain or a call centre.</p> <div class="diff-lead"> <div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/heart.svg" alt=""></div> <h3>Good Enough for Dad</h3> <p>We only hire carers we'd trust with our own families. In fact, our carers support my own dad.</p> </div> </div> <div class="diff-list reveal"> <div class="dl"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/team.svg" alt=""></div><div><h4>A small, dedicated team</h4><p>Tight-knit, so carers get to know each client and family properly.</p></div></div> <div class="dl"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/pin.svg" alt=""></div><div><h4>Local &amp; personal</h4><p>Based in Trowbridge and just around the corner — always close by.</p></div></div> <div class="dl"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/phone.svg" alt=""></div><div><h4>Care App transparency</h4><p>Families see real-time updates from every visit, for total peace of mind.</p></div></div> <div class="dl"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/clock.svg" alt=""></div><div><h4>Visits that suit you</h4><p>From a quick daily call-in to a full day together — care that flexes around life.</p></div></div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="section trustwhy"><div class="wrap"><div class="promise-top reveal"><img class="promise-photo" src="/img/promise-dad.jpg" alt="Jamie, our founder, with his father"><div class="promise-words"><span class="eyebrow">Our promise</span><h2 style="font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin-top:8px">“Care should feel like family — because for us, it started with family.”</h2><p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px">— Jamie, Founder of Otter Homecare</p></div></div><div class="video-embed reveal" data-yt="lYQKT_XjQTo" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Play film: Would it be good enough for my dad?" style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/lYQKT_XjQTo/maxresdefault.jpg" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src=&#39;https://img.youtube.com/vi/lYQKT_XjQTo/hqdefault.jpg&#39;" alt="Jamie speaking about the Good Enough for Dad promise"><span class="playbtn"><span></span></span><span class="vlabel">Film: Good Enough for Dad</span></div></div></section>  <section class="section trustwhy" id="trust-why"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="head-c reveal"> <span class="dots-motif" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/otter-tt.png" alt=""></span> <h2>Peace of mind, built in</h2> </div> <div class="trust3"> <div class="t3 reveal"><span class="ix">01</span><h3>Fully CQC-regulated</h3><p>Independently inspected against the highest national standards — never an unregulated introductory agency.</p></div> <div class="t3 reveal"><span class="ix">02</span><h3>Our own carers</h3><p>Directly employed and trained by us. No freelancers, no agency staff — just familiar, friendly faces.</p></div> <div class="t3 reveal"><span class="ix">03</span><h3>Matched &amp; consistent</h3><p>The same small team of carers, who get to know you, your routine and the things that matter most.</p></div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="section happyhour"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="hh-card reveal"> <div class="hh-copy"> <span class="tag">a little joy, on us ♥</span> <h2>Otter Happy Hour</h2> <p>Every month we gift a free hour of care — to spend on whatever brings a smile. A trip to the garden centre, a favourite cake, or simply more time together.</p> </div> <div class="hh-emblem has-photo"><img src="/img/rm-hilltop.png" alt="A client enjoying an Otter Happy Hour trip up to the White Horse"></div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="section help" id="help"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="head-c reveal"> <span class="dots-motif" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/otter-tt.png" alt=""></span> <h2>Support tailored to everyday life</h2> <p class="lede">Our Care Professionals are trained across a wide range of support — mixed and matched to suit you.</p> </div> <div class="help-grid"> <div class="help-item reveal"><img src="/img/ff72ba_83df1eb983a540ec9504319d2046ca73~mv2.jpg" alt=""><span>Personal care</span></div> <div class="help-item reveal"><img src="/img/ff72ba_ccfd35686af147f6a016e747c91942d6~mv2.jpg" alt=""><span>Medication management</span></div> <div class="help-item reveal"><img src="/img/ff72ba_65e6bbb5381c4de39626e5fd8be7f9aa~mv2.jpg" alt=""><span>Meal preparation</span></div> <div class="help-item reveal"><img src="/img/ff72ba_7402ffd16d2848ac9e7a9bb2ac85cdf9~mv2.jpg" alt=""><span>Transportation</span></div> <div class="help-item reveal"><img src="/img/ff72ba_937a9c9f723a4acbb4b07d6c06efc354~mv2.jpg" alt=""><span>Hobbies &amp; interests</span></div> <div class="help-item reveal"><img src="/img/ff72ba_bcb4f2e40c2f405b8d0b51b783e888b2~mv2.jpg" alt=""><span>Physical activity</span></div> <div class="help-item reveal"><img src="/img/ff72ba_2b291b82c9c04a17b6b9a51f6953fd1f~mv2.jpg" alt=""><span>Home help</span></div> <div class="help-item reveal"><img src="/img/ff72ba_65e6bbb5381c4de39626e5fd8be7f9aa~mv2.jpg" alt=""><span>Grocery shopping</span></div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="section steps" id="steps"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="head-c reveal"> <h2>A simple, reassuring process</h2> </div> <div class="steps-grid"><div class="step reveal"><span class="step-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .4 1.9.7 2.8a2 2 0 0 1-.4 2.1L8 9.9a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.8.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.8 2z"></path></svg><span class="step-num">1</span></span><h3>Call us</h3><p>Complimentary, expert guidance tailored to your needs.</p></div> <div class="step reveal"><span class="step-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"></path><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"></path></svg><span class="step-num">2</span></span><h3>Home visit</h3><p>Our qualified manager visits to create your tailored care plan.</p></div> <div class="step reveal"><span class="step-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.7l-1-1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8l1 1L12 21l7.8-7.6 1-1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8z"></path></svg><span class="step-num">3</span></span><h3>Start care</h3><p>Your matched Care Professional begins support on your terms.</p></div> <div class="step reveal"><span class="step-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M23 4v6h-6"></path><path d="M1 20v-6h6"></path><path d="M3.5 9a9 9 0 0 1 14.8-3.4L23 10M1 14l4.7 4.4A9 9 0 0 0 20.5 15"></path></svg><span class="step-num">4</span></span><h3>Ongoing</h3><p>We review and adapt your care as your needs change.</p></div></div> <div class="quizcard reveal"> <div><h3>Not sure what care you need?</h3><p>Answer a few quick questions and we'll point you in the right direction — no pressure, no jargon.</p></div> <a class="btn btn-clay" href="#book">Get in touch →</a> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="section app" id="app"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="reveal"> <h2>Stay connected to the moments that matter</h2> <p class="lede" style="margin:10px 0 22px">Our Care App keeps the whole family gently in the loop — wherever they are.</p> <div class="fl"><span class="ix">01</span><div><h4>See who's visiting today</h4><p>Know exactly when your carer has been and when they're due.</p></div></div> <div class="fl"><span class="ix">02</span><div><h4>Read real visit notes</h4><p>From breakfast choices to how they're feeling — all recorded with care.</p></div></div> <div class="fl"><span class="ix">03</span><div><h4>Access care records anytime</h4><p>Easily view care plans, assessments and updates.</p></div></div> <div class="fl"><span class="ix">04</span><div><h4>Know medication's been taken</h4><p>Confidence that medication's been given and needs are met.</p></div></div> <div class="video-embed reveal" data-yt="vnTnK0pfv0c" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Play video: Using the Otter Homecare app" style="margin-top:26px"><img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/vnTnK0pfv0c/maxresdefault.jpg" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src=&#39;https://img.youtube.com/vi/vnTnK0pfv0c/hqdefault.jpg&#39;" alt="Using the Otter Homecare Care App"><span class="playbtn"><span></span></span><span class="vlabel">See the Care App in action</span></div> </div> <div class="app-stage reveal"> <div class="phone"><img src="/img/ff72ba_92c3196bddda4a5f87fda89ca88bb38b~mv2.png" alt="The Otter Care App showing a visit summary"></div> <div class="app-co co1"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><div><b>Visit complete</b><small>Notes added · 09:32</small></div></div><div class="app-co co2"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2.5" y="8.5" width="19" height="7" rx="3.5"></rect><line x1="12" y1="8.5" x2="12" y2="15.5"></line></svg></span><div><b>Medication given</b><small>On time, every visit</small></div></div><div class="app-co co3"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 21s7-6.3 7-11a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 4.7 7 11 7 11z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"></circle></svg></span><div><b>Carer on the way</b><small>Sarah arrives 8:30</small></div></div><div class="app-co co4"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"></path></svg></span><div><b>Next visit booked</b><small>Tomorrow, 9:00am</small></div></div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="section tmt hcrev" id="stories"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="head-c reveal"> <h2>The families we look after</h2> </div> <div class="story reveal"> <div class="story-pic"><img src="/img/ff72ba_a006c15eb20c4eb1b0930b2825f55912~mv2.jpg" alt="A client at home"></div> <div class="story-body"> <div class="star">★★★★★</div> <blockquote>"After Mum's fall we were terrified she'd have to leave the home she's lived in for 40 years. Otter sat with us, built a plan around her, and matched her with two carers she now calls friends. She's still in her own kitchen — and we finally sleep at night."</blockquote> <div class="by">Helen F<span>Daughter of Client · via homecare.co.uk</span></div> </div> </div> <div class="hc-bar reveal"> <div class="hc-score"> <div class="hc-badge">9.4</div> <div><b>Review Score for Otter Homecare</b><small>Based on 14 verified reviews</small></div> </div> <a class="hc-brand" href="https://www.homecare.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/assets/homecare-logo.png" alt="homecare.co.uk"></a> </div> <div class="hc-grid"> <div class="hc-card reveal"> <div class="hc-top"><span class="hc-stars">★★★★☆</span><span class="hc-date">27 Mar 2026</span></div> <p>"Otter staff are superb in every way. They are kind, and really understand what being caring carers is all about."</p> <div class="hc-by">Frances W<span>Client</span></div> </div> <div class="hc-card reveal"> <div class="hc-top"><span class="hc-stars">★★★★★</span><span class="hc-date">12 Dec 2025</span></div> <p>"All home care should be as good as this. Lovely carers, nothing is too much trouble — they don't just do the job, they care."</p> <div class="hc-by">E S<span>Client</span></div> </div> <div class="hc-card reveal"> <div class="hc-top"><span class="hc-stars">★★★★★</span><span class="hc-date">14 Oct 2025</span></div> <p>"The Otter Home Care staff were incredibly kind and considerate in all their dealings with me and my family."</p> <div class="hc-by">J K<span>Stepson of Client</span></div> </div> <div class="hc-card reveal"> <div class="hc-top"><span class="hc-stars">★★★★★</span><span class="hc-date">30 Sep 2025</span></div> <p>"I cannot recommend Otter Home Care highly enough. We used them to provide care for my elderly dad and they were wonderful."</p> <div class="hc-by">Helen F<span>Daughter of Client</span></div> </div> </div> <div class="hc-foot reveal"> <a href="https://www.homecare.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read all 14 reviews on homecare.co.uk →</a> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="section benefits" id="benefits"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="reveal"> <h2>Stay in the place you love</h2> <p class="lede">For many families, staying at home with the right support is the most comfortable — and most empowering — option.</p> <div class="blist"> <div class="b"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/home.svg" alt=""></div><div><b>Stay in the place you love</b><p>No need to leave home or uproot your life.</p></div></div> <div class="b"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/key.svg" alt=""></div><div><b>Keep your independence</b><p>Care fits around your routine, not the other way around.</p></div></div> <div class="b"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/pound.svg" alt=""></div><div><b>Pay only for the time you need</b><p>Flexible, tailored support — never more than you use.</p></div></div> <div class="b"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/heart.svg" alt=""></div><div><b>One-to-one attention</b><p>Care that's personal, consistent and centred around you.</p></div></div> <div class="b"><div class="ic"><img src="/assets/icons/paw.svg" alt=""></div><div><b>Stay close to your pets</b><p>Keep the comfort of your companions by your side.</p></div></div> </div> </div> <div class="pic reveal"><img src="/img/ff72ba_a006c15eb20c4eb1b0930b2825f55912~mv2.jpg" alt="Client enjoying tea at home"></div> </div> </section>  <section class="section careers" id="careers"> <div class="wrap reveal"> <div class="careers-copy"> <h2 style="margin-top:0">Become an Otter Care Professional</h2> <p class="lede" style="color:#4a3408;margin:12px 0 0;max-width:34ch">Join a small, local team who genuinely look out for each other — with proper training, flexible hours and industry-leading pay.</p> <div class="perks"><span>Flexible hours</span><span>Industry-leading pay</span><span>Full training &amp; support</span><span>A supportive team</span></div> <a class="btn btn-clay" href="/careers" style="margin-top:22px">Find out more →</a> </div> <img class="careers-otter" src="/assets/otter-mascot.png" alt="Friendly Otter Homecare mascot waving" loading="lazy"> </div> </section> <div class="wave wave--to-teal" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 1200 90" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path class="rip-back" d="M0,34 C200,66 420,8 640,34 C860,60 1020,24 1200,42 L1200,90 L0,90 Z"></path><path class="rip-front" d="M0,60 C240,90 470,40 700,60 C940,80 1080,54 1200,66 L1200,90 L0,90 Z"></path></svg></div>  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="mgroup-head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Real moments</span><h2>Going above and beyond</h2><p class="lede">Person-centred care isn't a slogan — it's the small, true things our team do every day.</p></div><div class="moments-grid"><div class="moment reveal"><img class="m-img" src="/img/rm-hilltop.png" alt="A client at the hilltop by the White Horse"><div class="m-body"><h3>To the top of the hill</h3><p>For our Otter Happy Hour, one lady asked to be taken to the spot where her late husband's ashes had been scattered, high up by the White Horse. We made it happen.</p><p class="m-quote">"It was especially nice as he got to come along."</p></div></div><div class="moment reveal"><img class="m-img" src="/img/rm-horses.jpeg" alt="An Otter Care Professional with a client at the stables"><div class="m-body"><h3>A morning with the horses</h3><p>A lady living with dementia had once helped at a local stable. So one morning we took her to see the horses, then for coffee and cake at the farm café. She was calm and happy all morning.</p></div></div><div class="moment reveal"><img class="m-img" src="/img/haircut.png" alt="Cherie, our Registered Manager, with a client after a haircut"><div class="m-body"><h3>A salon at home</h3><p>A gentleman who used to go a long time between haircuts now gets a regular trim from Cherie, our Registered Manager — a fresh cut, a good chat, and a bit of dignity.</p></div></div></div><div class="moments-more reveal"><a href="/real-moments">More real moments →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section book" id="book"> <div class="wrap"> <div class="reveal"> <span class="eyebrow" style="color:#9fc4bf">Free, no-obligation assessment</span> <h2>Let's find the right care, together</h2> <p class="lede">Tell us a little about who needs support and we'll be in touch to arrange a free home visit — at a time that suits you.</p> <div class="reassure"> <div><span class="ic">✓</span> Free, no-obligation home visit</div> <div><span class="ic">✓</span> A tailored care plan, built around you</div> <div><span class="ic">✓</span> Speak to a real local person — never a call centre</div> </div> <div class="callbox"> <small>Prefer to talk? Call us any time</small> <a href="tel:01225690022">01225 690022</a> </div> </div> <div class="reveal"> <form class="form" id="bookForm" action="/api/contact" method="POST" novalidate> <h3>Book a free assessment</h3> <p class="fhint">We usually reply the same day.</p> <input type="text" name="company" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="display:none"> <div class="frow"> <div class="field"><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" name="name" type="text" required placeholder="Jane Smith"></div> <div class="field"><label for="phone">Phone</label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" required placeholder="07700 900000"></div> </div> <div class="field"><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="jane@example.com"></div> <div class="frow"> <div class="field"><label for="who">Who is the care for?</label><select id="who" name="who"><option>My parent</option><option>My partner</option><option>Myself</option><option>Another relative</option><option>Someone else</option></select></div> <div class="field"><label for="area">Your area</label><select id="area" name="area"><option>Trowbridge</option><option>Bradford-on-Avon</option><option>Melksham</option><option>Westbury</option><option>Frome</option><option>Elsewhere nearby</option></select></div> </div> <div class="field"><label for="msg">How can we help? (optional)</label><textarea id="msg" name="msg" placeholder="A little about the support you're looking for…"></textarea></div> <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Request my free assessment →</button> <p class="privacy">Your details are kept private and never shared. See our <a href="/privacy" style="text-decoration:underline">privacy policy</a>.</p> </form> <div class="form-success" id="formSuccess"> <div class="tick">✓</div> <h3>Thank you — we've got it</h3> <p>One of our local team will be in touch very soon to arrange your free visit. If it's urgent, please call <strong>01225 690022</strong>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="accred"> <div class="wrap"> <span class="lab">Regulated &amp; accredited</span> <a href="https://www.cqc.org.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/img/ff72ba_1dd84e5fdfa54621847dc493095a773f~mv2.jpg" alt="Regulated by the Care Quality Commission"></a> <a href="https://www.homecareassociation.org.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/img/ff72ba_91a56724044b4b7e9b3fcaf45212292b~mv2.png" alt="Member of the Homecare Association"></a> <a class="wide" href="https://www.homecare.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/img/ff72ba_08d2912203b449fcb907fb6fa089403a~mv2.jpg" alt="Reviewed on homecare.co.uk"></a> </div> </section> <script is:inline>
    const f = document.getElementById("bookForm");
    if (f) f.addEventListener("submit", async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const btn = f.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
      const data = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(f).entries());
      btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = "Sending…";
      try {
        const res = await fetch("/api/contact", {
          method: "POST",
          headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json", Accept: "application/json" },
          body: JSON.stringify(data),
        });
        const json = await res.json();
        if (res.ok && json.ok) {
          f.classList.add("hide");
          document.getElementById("formSuccess").classList.add("show");
        } else {
          btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = "Request my free assessment →";
          alert(json.error || "Something went wrong — please call us on 01225 690022.");
        }
      } catch {
        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = "Request my free assessment →";
        alert("Something went wrong — please call us on 01225 690022.");
      }
    });
  </script>

  <!-- KILT promise bubble — rotating value catchphrases (design's otter speech bubble) -->
  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      var kb = document.getElementById("kiltBubble");
      if (!kb || window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches) return;
      var kq = [
        ["", "That's why I wear the kilt!"],
        ["Kindness", "We keep each other warm."],
        ["Initiative", "We go the extra mile."],
        ["Learning", "We never stop getting better."],
        ["Teamwork", "No otter floats alone."],
      ];
      var ki = 0;
      setInterval(function () {
        ki = (ki + 1) % kq.length;
        kb.classList.add("fade");
        setTimeout(function () {
          var lab = kb.querySelector(".kb-label");
          lab.textContent = kq[ki][0];
          lab.style.display = kq[ki][0] ? "block" : "none";
          kb.querySelector(".kb-quote").textContent = kq[ki][1];
          kb.classList.remove("fade");
        }, 360);
      }, 4200);
    })();
  </script>
